{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Discord channel:\u00a0  \u3010For any game issues, please contact us in discord.\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.avif?t=1758725044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.webp?t=1758725044 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Apartment is a bizarre building controlled by the Clown Evil God. It contains an almost endless space, a variety of strange rooms, and an unceasing stream of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend has it that a way to fulfill any wish can be found in Fallen Apartment. However, most people who enter this mansion lose their souls and become the Evil God's playthings for all eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, our heroines have not easily surrendered to the Evil God. They still have the chance to face the Evil God directly and defeat him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cbBizarre storylines and exquisite full-motion CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cbFull-motion character sprites with multiple layers of clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cbDozens of relics and weapons with distinct abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cbNew Game Plus feature and branching endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.avif?t=1758725044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.webp?t=1758725044 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 